This is syntactically invalid Python (empty line after `else:`) and logically wrong (returning lambda string for constants).

Also, the removal of `visit_Dict`, `visit_Index`, `visit_Lambda` will break other functionality.

The `visit_Tuple` fix itself looks correct, but the surrounding damage to the file means the code likely won't run at all or will fail on other test cases.

